  "notes": [
    "Regular -AR verb, no exceptions",
    "Past participle: *echado* (regular)",
    "**Echar** has many high-frequency fixed expressions:",
    "*echar de menos* — to miss (a person or thing)",
    "*echar una mano* — to lend a hand / to help out",
    "*echar la culpa* — to blame",
    "*echar un vistazo* — to have a look / to glance at",
    "*echar a perder* — to ruin / to spoil",
    "*echarse a reír/llorar* — to burst out laughing/crying",
    "*echar de casa* — to throw out of the house",
    "Related: *el echo* is not a word — use *el lanzamiento* (throw) or the expression itself"
